[{"code":"invalid_attribute_name","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/MarkupInvalidAttributeName.beni","start":{"line":9,"col":9},"end":{"line":9,"col":20}},"title":"INVALID ATTRIBUTE NAME","message":"`\"x onclick\"` cannot be an attribute's name: it holds whitespace.\n\nA page ends an attribute's name at whitespace, a quote, `=`, `/` or `>`, and\nwhat follows begins another attribute, which the vocabulary never sees:\n`\"x onclick\"` would write an event handler. A quoted name may hold any other\ncharacter but a control character."},{"code":"invalid_attribute_name","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/MarkupInvalidAttributeName.beni","start":{"line":10,"col":9},"end":{"line":10,"col":22}},"title":"INVALID ATTRIBUTE NAME","message":"`\"a=1 onclick\"` cannot be an attribute's name: it holds `=`.\n\nA page ends an attribute's name at whitespace, a quote, `=`, `/` or `>`, and\nwhat follows begins another attribute, which the vocabulary never sees:\n`\"x onclick\"` would write an event handler. A quoted name may hold any other\ncharacter but a control character."},{"code":"invalid_attribute_name","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/MarkupInvalidAttributeName.beni","start":{"line":11,"col":9},"end":{"line":11,"col":21}},"title":"INVALID ATTRIBUTE NAME","message":"`\"x\\nonclick\"` cannot be an attribute's name: it holds whitespace.\n\nA page ends an attribute's name at whitespace, a quote, `=`, `/` or `>`, and\nwhat follows begins another attribute, which the vocabulary never sees:\n`\"x onclick\"` would write an event handler. A quoted name may hold any other\ncharacter but a control character."},{"code":"invalid_attribute_name","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/MarkupInvalidAttributeName.beni","start":{"line":12,"col":9},"end":{"line":12,"col":23}},"title":"INVALID ATTRIBUTE NAME","message":"`\"\\u{0}onclick\"` cannot be an attribute's name: it holds a control character.\n\nA page 